      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.9,
      "text": "When does a workload need a change of infrastructure?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.58,
      "end": 8.0,
      "text": "Rehost means Migrate Infrastructure while preserving much of the existing"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.0,
      "end": 8.846333,
      "text": "application."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.846333,
      "end": 14.666333,
      "text": "The playbook structures approval, destination preparation, movement, validation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.975563769230767,
      "end": 18.806333000000002,
      "text": "cutover, stabilization, measurement, and learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.806333000000002,
      "end": 23.897812000000002,
      "text": "EMOS plans and tracks this work; it does not perform the migration or cutover."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.897812000000002,
      "end": 30.517812000000003,
      "text": "Next, verify the target environment, dependencies, rollback plan, and human approval"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.517812000000003,
      "end": 33.037811999999995,
      "text": "before delivery teams proceed."
    }
